# 2026-03-26 15:03:46.773999
+Blitz the current Bourgaeux MVP forward without breaking what already works. Keep the existing AI recommendation flow fully working, but improve the product quality and app structure so this feels like a stronger startup prototype. Focus on three things only in this pass: first, make the homepage and onboarding/results experience feel more polished and productized; second, strengthen the recommendation output experience so the generated result looks more structured, premium, and easier to scan; third, make the API and AI prompt logic a little more robust so failures are handled better and output quality is more consistent. Do not add Supabase yet in this pass. Do not remove existing features. Keep the dark premium luxury-tech direction. Keep code clean, production-minded, and easy to extend into a social lifestyle product later. If needed, lightly improve copy to better position Bourgaeux as a lifestyle intelligence network for food, drink, entertainment, things to do, places to go, and blind-spot discovery. Avoid unnecessary dependencies. Preserve existing routes and keep the app easy to deploy on Vercel.

