# 2026-03-26 15:10:43.578028
+Turn Bourgaeux into a clearer social-plus-AI product on the homepage. Keep the assistant flow working, but make the page communicate that Bourgaeux is not just a recommendation form, it is the foundation of a lifestyle intelligence network. Improve the hero, page structure, section ordering, and preview surfaces so the user immediately understands three things: one, Bourgaeux helps them discover experiences they are missing; two, it can become a social platform for food, drink, entertainment, places, and things to do; three, their taste identity can become a meaningful product surface. Strengthen the feed preview so it looks more like a believable future app surface. Strengthen the onboarding area so it feels like a premium concierge-style assistant. Strengthen the result presentation so it feels high-signal and worth returning to. Keep the visual direction premium, restrained, dark, elegant, and mobile-friendly. Do not introduce clutter or over-design. Make the overall homepage feel like the front end of a real venture-backed consumer startup.

