+SYSTEM MODE: PORTFOLIO PREMIUM UI UPGRADE
+
+Venture: bourgaeux
+
+Premium visual system requirements:
+
+- Use a dark, premium, investor-ready aesthetic
+- Prefer deep navy, midnight blue, charcoal, and black backgrounds
+- Use subtle radial glows, soft gradients, and elegant atmospheric lighting
+- Use bold, high-contrast typography with large, confident headlines
+- Use gradient CTA buttons with warm orange, coral, pink, violet, or premium accent blends where appropriate
+- Use dark glassmorphism or soft translucent cards with rounded corners
+- Use clean spacing, stronger hierarchy, and premium section separation
+- Use grid-based layouts for showcase cards and product areas
+- Use refined shadows, subtle borders, and soft highlights
+- Avoid clutter, amateur gradients, random colors, and generic SaaS blandness
+- Make the product look like a premium holding company / venture platform / modern Apple-keynote-meets-high-end-startup brand
+- Improve mobile responsiveness, section rhythm, card consistency, and visual polish
+- Keep the venture’s own category and positioning, but translate it into the same premium design language
+
+Execution instructions:
+- upgrade the UI to match this premium visual system
+- improve layout, spacing, card design, section hierarchy, typography, button styling, mobile responsiveness, and polish
+- preserve the venture’s product meaning and content while making it feel aligned with Noaerth’s premium visual language
+- fix related visual inconsistencies across shared sections and core pages
+- keep the project buildable
+- do not ask questions
+- make the result feel materially more premium

